' 狙い: participant order (宣言順を無視した create/destroy の出現順)と
' create/destroy を同一の相手に対して複数回繰り返すパターン
@startuml
participant Main

Main -> Main : start
create Worker
Main -> Worker : run(job1)
Worker --> Main : done1
destroy Worker

create Worker
Main -> Worker : run(job2)
Worker --> Main : done2
destroy Worker

create Logger
Main -> Logger : write(summary)
destroy Logger
@enduml
